# The Lockheed Martin F-35A Lightning II's checklists: this project's own, in its own words.
#
# **They are not taken from the aeroplane's flight manual.** No such
# manual was read to write them. What they follow is the ordinary
# practice for the type, in the order it is flown; the speeds and
# settings in them are this project's own figures, assets/figures/f35a.xml,
# whose sources docs/ASSETS.md records, and the flight model itself
# wherever the model is what decides - a lever's gate, a flap's travel,
# an engine's idle.
#
#   phase NAME                       one of: before-start, taxi, take-off,
#                                    climb, cruise, descent, approach,
#                                    landing, after-landing
#   check PROPERTY OP VALUE TEXT...  an item the aircraft can see done
#   range PROPERTY LOW HIGH TEXT...  the same, where a band shows it done
#   confirm TEXT...                  an item only the pilot can see done
#
# with `#` beginning a comment; src/sim/checklist.hpp owns the format.
#
# The model gives this aeroplane no flap lever and no speedbrake lever: its
# flaperons are worked by the roll channel alone. So nothing here reads a
# flap or a speedbrake setting, and what a pilot would do with them is left
# as the pilot's to confirm. Its one F135 lights its reheat above a throttle
# of 0.99, which is what "into reheat" and "no reheat" mean here, and being a
# single-engined aeroplane it has only engine 0 to read.

phase before-start
confirm Walk-round done and the aeroplane clear to start
confirm Strapped in, harness tight and the ejection seat pins stowed
confirm Oxygen on, mask checked and the canopy clear
confirm Weapons bay doors shut and the master arm off
check fcs/throttle-cmd-norm <= 0.05 Throttle closed
check gear/gear-cmd-norm >= 0.95 Undercarriage lever down

phase taxi
check propulsion/engine[0]/n1 >= 35.0 The engine running and settled at idle
check gear/gear-pos-norm >= 0.95 Undercarriage down and locked
confirm Brakes and nose wheel steering checked as the aeroplane first moves
confirm Flying controls swept through their travel and watched
check fcs/throttle-cmd-norm <= 0.40 Taxi at a walking pace on low power

phase take-off
range fcs/pitch-trim-cmd-norm -0.35 0.35 Pitch trim set for the take-off
confirm Canopy closed and locked, and the take-off briefed
confirm Flaperons and the take-off setting checked by eye, there being no flap lever to read
check fcs/throttle-cmd-norm >= 0.99 Throttle fully forward, into reheat
check velocities/vc-kts >= 140.0 Ease the nose up at 140 knots

phase climb
check gear/gear-cmd-norm <= 0.05 Undercarriage lever up
check gear/gear-pos-norm <= 0.05 Undercarriage locked up
range velocities/vc-kts 300.0 400.0 Climb at 300 to 400 knots
check position/h-agl-ft >= 1000.0 Above a thousand feet and climbing away
confirm Engine instruments and the fuel's rate of burn checked

phase cruise
range velocities/mach 0.75 0.90 Cruise at Mach 0.75 to 0.90
range position/h-sl-ft 30000.0 45000.0 Level between 30,000 and 45,000 feet
check fcs/throttle-cmd-norm <= 0.99 Military power, no reheat
check gear/gear-pos-norm <= 0.05 Undercarriage up
confirm Fuel checked against the leg still to fly

phase descent
range fcs/throttle-cmd-norm 0.0 0.60 Throttle back for the descent
check velocities/vc-kts <= 450.0 Down at no more than 450 knots
confirm Altimeter set to the field's pressure
confirm No airbrake on this aeroplane to lean on, so the descent is begun early

phase approach
check gear/gear-cmd-norm >= 0.95 Undercarriage lever down
check gear/gear-pos-norm >= 0.95 Undercarriage down and locked
range velocities/vc-kts 145.0 175.0 Approach at 145 to 175 knots
confirm Runway in sight and the landing light on
confirm Weapons bay doors shut for the landing

phase landing
range velocities/vc-kts 140.0 160.0 Over the threshold at 140 to 160 knots
check gear/gear-pos-norm >= 0.95 Undercarriage down and locked
check fcs/throttle-cmd-norm <= 0.25 Throttle closed in the flare
confirm Fly it onto the main wheels and hold the nose off

phase after-landing
check position/h-agl-ft <= 50.0 Down and rolling
check velocities/vc-kts <= 40.0 Clear of the runway and slowed to a taxi
check fcs/throttle-cmd-norm <= 0.35 Throttle back to a taxi power
confirm Master arm off and the landing light out
